---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Draft privacy information for Aidan Brotherhood." noindex={true}>
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose prose-lg surface-card p-5 sm:p-8">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p>
        This is a draft privacy notice for private review. The site can collect newsletter signup details and coaching
        enquiry information so Aidan Brotherhood can respond to enquiries and send requested email updates.
      </p>
      <h2>What is collected</h2>
      <p>
        Newsletter signup collects first name, last name, email address, source page, and basic UTM attribution when
        present. Coaching enquiries collect the contact and lead qualification details submitted through the form.
      </p>
      <h2>How it is used</h2>
      <p>
        The information is used to reply to coaching enquiries, understand what support may be appropriate, and manage
        newsletter subscriptions. The Get Started form should not be used for detailed medical information, PAR-Q
        answers, medication history, diagnoses, or injury records.
      </p>
      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        When configured, newsletter signups are sent to Buttondown and coaching enquiries are sent to Attio. This page
        should be reviewed and finalised before a public launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
